{
  "category": "Fox Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "Very smart and very vengeful. Grabbing one of its many tails could result in a 1000-year curse.",
      "version": "red"
    },
    {
      "text": "Very smart and very vengeful. Grabbing one of its many tails could result in a 1000-year curse.",
      "version": "blue"
    },
    {
      "text": "According to an enduring legend, 9 noble saints were united and reincarnated as this POKéMON.",
      "version": "yellow"
    },
    {
      "text": "Some legends claim that each of its nine tails has its own unique type of special mystical power.",
      "version": "gold"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its nine beautiful tails are filled with a wondrous energy that could keep it alive for 1,000 years.",
      "version": "silver"
    },
    {
      "text": "It is said to live a thousand years, and each of its tails is loaded with supernatural powers.",
      "version": "crystal"
    },
    {
      "text": "NINETALES casts a sinister light from its bright red eyes to gain total control over its foe’s mind. This POKéMON is said to live for a thousand years.",
      "version": "ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "Legend has it that NINETALES came into being when nine wizards possessing sacred powers merged into one. This POKéMON is highly intelligent - it can understand human speech.",
      "version": "sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "It has long been said that each of the nine tails embody an enchanted power. A long-lived NINETALES will have fur that shines like gold.",
      "version": "emerald"
    },
    {
      "text": "It has nine long tails and fur that gleams gold. It is said to live for 1,000 years.",
      "version": "firered"
    },
    {
