    {
      "text": "Very smart and very vengeful. Grabbing one of its many tails could result in a 1,000-year curse.",
      "version": "y"
    },
    {
      "text": "Ninetales casts a sinister light from its bright red eyes to gain total control over its foe’s mind. This Pokémon is said to live for a thousand years.",
      "version": "omega-ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "Legend has it that Ninetales came into being when nine wizards possessing sacred powers merged into one. This Pokémon is highly intelligent—it can understand human speech.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "Legend has it that this mystical Pokémon was formed when nine saints coalesced into one.",
      "version": "sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "Said to live for a thousand years, this Pokémon uses its supernatural abilities to manipulate fire. It can burn its prey to a crisp as it pleases.",
      "version": "moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "It is vindictive and relentless by nature. Those who cross it even once will be cursed for a thousand years, along with their descendants.",
      "version": "ultra-sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "The flickering flames it spews from its mouth leave its opponents hypnotized. Then, this extremely intelligent Pokémon attacks.",
      "version": "ultra-moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "According to an enduring legend, nine noble saints were united and reincarnated as this Pokémon.",
      "version": "lets-go-pikachu"
    },
    {
      "text": "According to an enduring legend, nine noble saints were united and reincarnated as this Pokémon.",
      "version": "lets-go-eevee"
    },
    {
      "text": "It is said to live 1,000 years, and each of its tails is loaded with supernatural powers.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "Very smart and very vengeful. Grabbing one of its many tails could result in a 1,000-year curse.",
      "version": "shield"
    },
    {
      "text": "The coat of gleaming golden fur is quite magnificent. This species is said to store sacred power in its nine long tails and to live for a millennium.",
      "version": "legends-arceus"
    }
